

Joining the Stacks Builder Challenges offers several advantages:

Early positioning in a growing L2 ecosystem

Stacks is one of the fastest-rising Bitcoin-anchored smart contract platforms. Early builders often gain disproportionate visibility.

Verifiable on-chain reputation

Every contribution strengthens your Talent Passport — your Web3 professional identity — which can help you attract collaborators, employers, or grants.

Direct token incentives

Consistent building translates into STX rewards, offering financial upside for meaningful work.

Appeal to both technical and non-technical builders

Because the campaign rewards GitHub activity and community contributions, it benefits not only smart contract developers but any builder who creates value.
